@startuml Deployment Diagram

!define TITLE Deployment Diagram - AI Training App Deployment

title TITLE

' Nodes
node "Client Device" as Client {
  component [Web Browser] as Browser
}

node "Streamlit Cloud\n(Production)" as Cloud {
  component [Streamlit Server] as StreamlitServer
  artifact "ai_training_app.py" as MainApp
  artifact "chatbot.py" as ChatbotModule
}

node "Local Development\nEnvironment" as Local {
  component [Python 3.8+] as Python
  component [Streamlit Local] as StreamlitLocal
  folder "Source Code" {
    artifact "ai_training_app.py" as MainAppLocal
    artifact "chatbot.py" as ChatbotLocal
  }
}

node "Data Storage" as Storage {
  database "pdf_content.txt\n(731KB)" as KB
  database "sample_data.csv" as SampleData
}

node "External APIs" as APIs {
  component [Wikipedia API] as WikiAPI
  component [Web Search] as WebAPI
}

node "Version Control" as VCS {
  component [GitHub Repository] as GitHub
  folder "Repository" {
    artifact "Python Files" as Code
    artifact "Requirements" as Req
    artifact "Documentation" as Docs
    artifact "UML Diagrams" as Diagrams
  }
}

' Relationships - Production
Browser --> StreamlitServer : HTTPS
StreamlitServer --> MainApp : executes
StreamlitServer --> ChatbotModule : loads
ChatbotModule --> KB : reads
MainApp --> SampleData : loads
ChatbotModule --> WikiAPI : REST API
ChatbotModule --> WebAPI : HTTP

' Relationships - Development
Python --> StreamlitLocal : runs
StreamlitLocal --> MainAppLocal : executes
StreamlitLocal --> ChatbotLocal : loads

' Relationships - Version Control
Local --> GitHub : git push
Cloud --> GitHub : git pull
GitHub --> Code : stores
GitHub --> Req : stores
GitHub --> Docs : stores
GitHub --> Diagrams : stores

' Notes
note right of Cloud
  Deployment Options:
  • Streamlit Cloud (Production)
  • Heroku
  • AWS/Azure/GCP
  • Docker Container
end note

note right of Local
  Development Setup:
  $ pip install -r requirements.txt
  $ streamlit run ai_training_app.py
  
  Localhost: http://localhost:8501
end note

note bottom of Storage
  Δεδομένα αποθηκεύονται
  στο repository και
  φορτώνονται κατά την εκτέλεση
end note

note top of VCS
  GitHub Repository:
  krimits/ai_training_app
  
  Branch: main
  License: MIT
end note

note left of Browser
  Supported Browsers:
  • Chrome
  • Firefox
  • Safari
  • Edge
end note

@enduml
